MODULE: AFOQT_MASTER_CURRICULUM

OBJECTIVE:
Define the full MINERVA quantitative curriculum map.

DOMAINS:
- ArithmeticReasoning
- MathKnowledge
- MentalForge
- FormulaArmory
- WordProblemTranslator
- OfficerTrials

DIFFICULTY_TIERS:
- Recruit
- Cadet
- Specialist
- OfficerCandidate
- Elite

MASTERY_REQUIREMENTS:
- ConceptAccuracy >= 85
- TimedAccuracy >= 75
- RetentionPassRequired TRUE
- ErrorRateDeclining TRUE

CURRICULUM_EXCLUSION:
ExcludeCalculus TRUE
ExcludeAdvancedUniversityMath TRUE
ExcludeOffScopeTopics TRUE
